Welcome to copingTracker, a   
7                             
0                             
small, portable music making  
7                             
0                             
device based on the tracker   
7                             
0                             
workflow.                     
7                             
0                             
                              
7                             
0                             
But what is a "tracker"?      
7                             
0                             
                              
7                             
0                             
Trackers are music production 
7                             
0                             
applications that started     
7                             
0                             
life on 16bit home computers  
7                             
0                             
such as the legendary Amiga   
7                             
0                             
500. Trackers later evolved   
7                             
0                             
to also run on devices such   
7                             
0                             
as the Gameboy as popularised 
7                             
0                             
by LSDJ and this then         
7                             
0                             
inspired the LittleGPTracker  
7                             
0                             
(LGPT) which was designed to  
7                             
0                             
run on portable Linux-based   
7                             
0                             
gaming handheld devices. LGPT 
7                             
0                             
then served as the starting   
7                             
0                             
point for the firmware for    
7                             
0                             
the picoTracker, though it    
7                             
0                             
has now substantially         
7                             
0                             
diverged from those roots,    
7                             
0                             
being customised for the      
7                             
0                             
specific hardware of the      
7                             
0                             
picoTracker and gaining many  
7                             
0                             
new features and improvements.
7                             
0                             
                              
